    "section_rich_text_7Lb9dX": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yJ7qgd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>1. From Concept to Completion</h4><p></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "subheading_zdgAVz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "our challenge:",
            "text_size": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_VQhBG3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hired in August 2024 to transform this storage room (see the 'before' image below), we delivered our full concept-to-completion interior design services approach:</p><p></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_kC8bAW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Site visit, measure-up, and CAD floor plans</li><li>3D visualisations </li><li>Mood boards and selecting materials </li><li>Sourcing all furniture, accessories, lighting  </li><li>Budgeting and obtaining trade quotes  </li><li>Project scheduling and management</li><li>Styling, finishing touches and a  photoshoot</li></ul>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "subheading_etpcVh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Dividing the space without walls:",
            "text_size": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_Th6Ezf": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The room was compact and filled with pillars - but instead of seeing obstacles, we saw opportunities.</p><p>By using <strong>flooring and finishes to create zones</strong>, we avoided partitions and kept the room open. Each area flows naturally into the next while still feeling distinct.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_CdhJe6": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The result? Four <strong>connected yet unique zones</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Coffee Bar</strong></li><li><strong>Media Lounge</strong></li><li><strong>Arcade Corner </strong></li><li><strong>Dining Space</strong></li></ul>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
