    "section_rich_text_6fbNzN": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_xT3htA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>2. Material & Colour</h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TTRkwU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The chosen palette of <strong>deep greens, soft greys, and brass accents</strong> created a <strong>sophisticated speakeasy atmosphere</strong>. LVT flooring with brass inlays not only elevated the design but also became a clever way to define each functional zone without adding walls.</p><p>After composing physical samples in our studio, we created this digital material board in <strong>Mattoboard,</strong> ready to annotate and present to the client.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
