    "section_rich_text_mRwGbr": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_PFKR8W": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>3. The Media Lounge: Comfort Meets Class</h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_PCTRHg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>One of the biggest challenges of the space was working around <strong>two radiators</strong> positioned on the feature wall. Rather than letting them dictate the design, we turned them into an opportunity. Using the existing pillars on either side, we built a <strong>bespoke TV wall frame</strong>, complete with <strong>slimline black metal vents</strong> to ensure airflow. </p><p>The rest of the wall was designed to be both functional and full of character. <strong>Open shelves</strong> gave room for styling and personality, while <strong>painted fluted MDF panels</strong> provided texture, catching the glow of the <strong>soft backlighting</strong> for added warmth and depth.</p><p>To soften the strong architectural lines, we introduced <strong>planters with trailing greenery</strong>, adding organic shapes and textures that also disguised the base of the windows. <strong>Walnut Egger panelling</strong> and <strong>integrated shelf lighting</strong> tied the look together, layering rich tones with a luxe finish.</p><p>Every last detail, from the <strong>lighting to the accessories and styling</strong>, was carefully curated by us.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_wDzT4C": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
