    "section_rich_text_wDJrER": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_y6VpDj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>5. The Arcade Corner: Small but Mighty</h4><p></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 10
          }
        },
        "text_NdfELf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>No breakout zone is complete without some fun. For this corner, space was limited - so we went <strong>bespoke</strong>:</p><ul><li>A <strong>custom arcade coffee table</strong></li><li>Paired <strong>Maze chairs</strong> for casual play</li><li>A <strong>custom darts mat</strong> and illuminated arrow sign</li><li>Playful details like a knots-and-crosses board and <strong>Star Trek blueprints</strong> for personality</li></ul><p>It’s a compact but unforgettable corner that captures the spirit of play and team bonding.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
